From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Jurgens <danielj@nvidia.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Jan 2026 04:09:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 117/243] NVIDIA: SAUCE: tegra_hv_ivc: Add interface for
 nvscicom driver

A new OOT driver to handle nvscicom queues has been added. It shares a
lot of functionality with tegra_hv, so breakup tegra_hv_ivc_setup and
export the new functions to allow reuse by the new driver.

For now the nvscicom driver is using the same IVC page from the
hypervisor, eventually there will be a new page and hypercall.

Bug 5628239

